{
  "_about": "Trades of vanilla villagers and the wandering trader, applied by kubejs/startup_scripts/villager_trades.js (docs/design.md, 'Villagers'). Replaces every vanilla and modded trade list: no emeralds, no vanilla iron or diamond gear, no enchanted books, no maps. Barter in TFC goods (there is no coin: copper ingots are the hard currency, as with the pack's Easy NPC traders). Each level of a profession lists the offers it can show; a villager picks 2 of them per level (the wandering trader 5 generic + 1 rare), as in vanilla. Era caps by level come from tools/structures/catalogue.json loot_caps: levels 1-2 stone, 3 copper (no bronze), 4-5 bronze. A profession missing here, or a villager level without a list, has no trades. Check with tools/villagers_test.py.",
